+Oracles
+-------
+The competing linkers are the PINNED oracles provisioned by
+tools/linker/setup_oracles.sh (GNU ld 2.47, mold 2.42.1 built for
+X86_64;I386, LLVM lld 23.1.x, optionally wild HEAD), found as the wrappers in
